                    579.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "3. A unit member who is Class 1-0, who is drafted and enters this type of program, shall be given Leave for Unusual and Imperative Reasons and upon release from his/her obligation shall be reinstated at the same or comparable position at the same salary step and in the same status as at the time his/her leave began.",
            "block_bbox": [
                87,
